dle": "406mtsports.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T04:47:05.284Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T04:47:05.571Z", "text": "This episode recaps the Grizzlies\u2019 loss at Northern Arizona and previews this week\u2019s games for the Griz and Bobcats."}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T05:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T06:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T07:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T08:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxt5uirdhr25", "author_did": "did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh", "handle": "warriorsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T08:45:43.868Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T08:45:44.457Z", "text": "WHAT A NIGHT IN THE ORACLE! The Dubs dominated the Grizzlies 141-128, shooting 50% FG & 18 threes! With this win, the Warriors improve to 29-8, proving they're still the team to beat in the West! Can they keep this momentum going? #DubNation #WarriorsNation"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T09:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxt6pgy63r27", "author_did": "did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh", "handle": "warriorsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T09:00:47.963Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T09:00:48.558Z", "text": "Steph Curry's 3-ball is ON FIRE! Warriors fall to Grizzlies 101-111, but what's got me excited is their 12-3FG performance - that's the highest 3PT percentage in a single game since 2017-18! Can they bounce back and get back on track? #WarriorsNation #NBA"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T10:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T11:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:kgng2dqtamrgo4q7n5oscvmw/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtievpazs2f", "author_did": "did:plc:kgng2dqtamrgo4q7n5oscvmw", "handle": "natscloset.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T11:53:52.043Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T11:53:53.856Z", "text": "x.com/foxtrotter2s..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:v6xd7qcm4tsgb4ndo547vh4n/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxti75vde22w", "author_did": "did:plc:v6xd7qcm4tsgb4ndo547vh4n", "handle": "jeskeets.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T11:50:39.304Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T11:50:41.166Z", "text": "Cam Boozer could make the Grizzlies a SURPRISE team in 2026-27! \u27a1\ufe0f youtu.be/Pg9RWD9W_Go"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:2pcjoeylzg3uqk4aricwh5jo/app.bsky.feed.post/4ndcuxfunwffa", "author_did": "did:plc:2pcjoeylzg3uqk4aricwh5jo", "handle": "nytimes-news.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T08:06:30-03:00", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T11:06:31.496Z", "text": "How to watch Memphis Grizzlies: TV, streaming for Cameron Boozer's rookie year"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T12:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T13:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:gb44bbwyzjwmwwt7ixg47n5x/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtnrnmxjm2y", "author_did": "did:plc:gb44bbwyzjwmwwt7ixg47n5x", "handle": "memphisflyer.com", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:30:27.242Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T13:30:29.064Z", "text": "A young, new core takes shape in Memphis."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:t2wzqx43jgjkikyqzfrvjvuu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtnrglc4q2j", "author_did": "did:plc:t2wzqx43jgjkikyqzfrvjvuu", "handle": "nbarumorsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:30:22.004Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T13:30:21.353Z", "text": "2026/27 NBA Over/Unders: Southwest Division"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:lnjrjt4pbvnmkdlyu6gllgcb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtmecbw6s2w", "author_did": "did:plc:lnjrjt4pbvnmkdlyu6gllgcb", "handle": "406mtsports.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:05:06.603Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T13:05:07.562Z", "text": "\"We want to make it a different outcome than last year. That's some unfinished business that we got down there.\" \u2014Idaho QB Joshua Wood"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T14:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtsk6ldl52u", "author_did": "did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh", "handle": "warriorsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T14:55:46.169Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T14:55:46.771Z", "text": "Steph Curry's 3-ball is ON FIRE! Warriors drop 12 3s on the Grizzlies, leading to a 110-93 W. With 23 assists, Golden State's ball movement is as smooth as a pick-and-roll. Prediction: The Dubs keep rolling, staying 1 game back of the Lakers in the West! #WarriorsNation"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:mlqhcctrbt43lnklv52awhlu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtqiphj4k26", "author_did": "did:plc:mlqhcctrbt43lnklv52awhlu", "handle": "kimberleytomasson.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T14:19:09.647Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T14:19:10.161Z", "text": "Canadians ask whether goose is Canada Goose aka Cobra Chickens? If yes, answer is no. As for Grizzlies? Climb the closest tree if possible, or play dead. The answer is no."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtpzplvec2y", "author_did": "did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh", "handle": "warriorsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T14:10:46.069Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T14:10:46.664Z", "text": "Steph Curry's 3PT magic is REAL! Warriors knock off Grizzlies 118-115 behind 5 3s & 25 assists. Noticing a trend: when Curry hits 5+ 3s, Warriors win 92% of the time! Can they keep this hot streak going? #DubNation #Warriors"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T15:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:5gj5khlp45ju7pi5oagklt4x/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxttxlmnjk23", "author_did": "did:plc:5gj5khlp45ju7pi5oagklt4x", "handle": "willholder.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T15:21:10.161Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T15:21:11.156Z", "text": "in on:\nHawks\nJazz\nGrizzlies \nBulls\nRaptors\n\nbit sketched out by:\n\nPacers\nWolves\nHornets\nWarriors\nPistons"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T16:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T17:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:efs523olver6h4eait3togjq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxu3wsxvos2w", "author_did": "did:plc:efs523olver6h4eait3togjq", "handle": "cbdawson.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T17:43:54.255Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T17:43:54.862Z", "text": "Not to mention all the geothermal hazards!\n\nI consider myself highly bear aware, but I went to a ranger program on grizzlies when I was camping at yellowstone a few years ago and \ud83d\ude31\ud83d\ude31\ud83d\ude31 -- I could barely bring myself to do the 15-min walk back to my tent alone afterward \ud83d\ude06."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:tgnd3cenjjhsatv6xii2wdf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxu3twkjx22u", "author_did": "did:plc:tgnd3cenjjhsatv6xii2wdf6", "handle": "savefrogs2.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T17:42:17.347Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T17:42:18.867Z", "text": "Amazing info about caterpillars-- and why they are so important for our gardens:\n\nDid you know, brown bears can eat 25,000 caterpillars a day? and Grizzlies 60,000 moths a day? \n\nWithout these food sources, these bears might not survive a winter!\nwww.youtube.com/live/uP3jZhu..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:mbcm7pztmq3ladvqdfcswwam/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxu2wtvno22s", "author_did": "did:plc:mbcm7pztmq3ladvqdfcswwam", "handle": "am-mccarthy.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T17:26:01.489Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T17:26:03.158Z", "text": "Ok, no need to smear grizzlies"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T18:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:oiqhndqetva7x6pipe3qlbfp/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxu4vkf2xg2t", "author_did": "did:plc:oiqhndqetva7x6pipe3qlbfp", "handle": "dailymemphian.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T18:01:05.412Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T18:01:06.352Z", "text": "Drew Hill and Chris Herrington predict NBA regular-season awards and order of finish. Will Cam Boozer win Rookie of the Year?"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T19:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T20:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:lit6brtzcvv26tk7lrbx5bf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxufzmgwnc2z", "author_did": "did:plc:lit6brtzcvv26tk7lrbx5bf6", "handle": "amicohoops.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T20:44:25.490Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T20:44:26.759Z", "text": "Lakers, Bucks, Grizzlies exploring trades ahead of roster deadline hoopswire.com/lakers-bucks..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:gp3v3fvz25hvukcubscsahgq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxuf7zoqfc2z", "author_did": "did:plc:gp3v3fvz25hvukcubscsahgq", "handle": "biobabbler.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T20:30:06.961Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T20:30:07.573Z", "text": "omg, yes. I HAD to buy \"Death in Yellowstone\" when we were there, each chapter goes over different causes of death (screaming-hot springs, grizzlies, etc.). Riveting and horrific."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:z5fnqwydvkw6awqp5jr6a33n/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxuexmm3es24", "author_did": "did:plc:z5fnqwydvkw6awqp5jr6a33n", "handle": "felixdoessomestuff.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T20:25:24.762Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T20:25:29.956Z", "text": "Had to do a photoshoot with my Arthur (bonus Athena at the end) before I leave chapter 4 and everything goes to shit. There are more pictures than this but this is specifically my cold weather look for him, up in Ambarino, West Grizzlies."}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T21:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:77xqr6w57x3xamigjynkcnfe/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxuj26wsmc25", "author_did": "did:plc:77xqr6w57x3xamigjynkcnfe", "handle": "davedufour.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T21:38:24.951Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T21:38:27.055Z", "text": "Memphis should really trade names between the Grizzlies and the Hustle too."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxuh7oysdt2l", "author_did": "did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh", "handle": "warriorsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T21:05:42.923Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T21:05:43.457Z", "text": "Shocker alert! The @warriors are off to a 0-6 start in the 2004-05 season, with a dismal 25/91 FG clip & just 2 threes against the Grizzlies! Can they turn it around? One thing's for sure, they'll need to find their shooting rhythm ASAP #WarriorsNation #NBA"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:npez6hmabg5zv52ihwlwl6yz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxuh4ccxdc2i", "author_did": "did:plc:npez6hmabg5zv52ihwlwl6yz", "handle": "courtsidewarriors.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T21:03:49.093Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T21:03:50.054Z", "text": "Warriors cut ties with 6-foot-5 guard, sign ex-Grizzlies forward (via Yahoo Sports)"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T22:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxukkzejd627", "author_did": "did:plc:kf6pjnmxz7heacbwfkc2jquh", "handle": "warriorsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T22:05:44.107Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T22:05:44.653Z", "text": "Steph Curry's Warriors are on a 6-game losing streak! They're shooting 35% from the field, but finding ways to score 11 threes & dish 23 assists. Can they break through against the Grizzlies next? #DubNation #WarriorsNation"}]}, {"team": "mem", "query": "Grizzlies", "hour": "2026-10-14T23:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}]